4. CONSISTENCY: drilldown's Total and credits' Unmatched amount use the
   IDENTICAL formula (`total -= t.Amount` per txn, i.e. same as
   `unmatchedTotal += -t.Amount`), so the same signed total is produced
   from the same transaction set. Found a bitwise float discrepancy
   (diff ~7.1e-15) driven by summation ORDER — bucketMajorExpenses sums
   over unmatchedTxns in match order, the drilldown sums after sorting by
   date descending — on a 5-transaction refund-dominant fixture: credits
   amount -38.86999999999999744205 vs drilldown Total
   -38.86999999999999033662.
