     IDENTICAL diff (-7.105427357601002e-15) for a MATCHED group's credit
     entry (pre-existing CB4 code, untouched by this task) using the same
     5-transaction fixture pattern. The float summation-order divergence
     is systemic to the bucketMajorExpenses/drilldown pair since CB3/CB4,
     not something CB5's guard or credits-append logic introduces.
   - Verified the remedy point: at DISPLAY precision (2 decimals, both
     Go %.2f-equivalent and the JS Intl.NumberFormat path) both values
     round to "-38.87" identically — the rendered strings agree exactly
